<title>SWEDEN: Volvo 1996 income/sale results by unit.</title>
<headline>Volvo 1996 income/sale results by unit.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1997-02-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Following is a breakdown of the results of Swedish vehicle maker AB Volvo's income and sales for its key individual units.</p>
<p> UNIT		   SALES		    OP. PROFIT (million skr)</p>
<p>			    '96	 '95	    '96	 '95</p>
<p> Volvo Car	     83,589	83,340     1,498	1,089</p>
<p> Volvo Truck	   44,275	51,027	 878	5,073</p>
<p> Volvo Bus		8,527	 7,695	 331	  405</p>
<p> Volvo Construction</p>
<p>   Equipment	   12,804	 6,916     1,162	  717</p>
<p> Volvo Penta	    3,885	 3,878	 -27	  212</p>
<p> Volvo Aero	     4,143	 3,790	 153	  103</p>
<p> Other		   -3,006	-2,150	-376	 -106</p>
<p> TOTAL VEHICLES     154,217     154,496     3,619	 7,493</p>
<p> Operations being</p>
<p>   divested	     1,843	17,015	  91	 1,531</p>
<p> GROUP TOTAL	  156,060     171,511     3,710	 9,024</p>
<p>    -- Stockholm newsroom +46-8-700 1045</p>
</text>
